Package: luci-app-glanim
Version: 1.9.11-1
Depends: luci, luci-compat, rpcd, python3-light
Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53_neon-vfpv4
Section: luci
Priority: optional
Title: Screen Custom for GL-BE3600
Maintainer: local
Description: Custom screen for the 284x76 ST7789 bar panel. Play an uploaded GIF / still / slideshow frame pack or run a live system information panel (clock, CPU, memory, temperature, network) with CST816X touch control. Stops OEM gl_screen while running and restores it on exit.
